Another example, where the comment actually moves inside another function def.

```python
class Foo:
    @abstractmethod
    def foo(self) -> None: ...
    # comment 1

    def baz(self) -> None:
        return None
```

becomes

```python
class Foo:
    @abstractmethod
    def foo(self) -> None: ...

    def baz(self) -> None:
    # comment 1
        return None
```

